OL,3,ASecond storm to hit UK with more wind
OL,4,Aand rain as thousands remain without
OL,5,Apower
OL,6,
OL,7,FA second storm in as many days is set
OL,8,Fto batter parts of the UK, as thousands
OL,9,Fremain without power following powerful
OL,10,Fwinds and heavy rain on Friday.
OL,12,FStorm Boelo is forecast to hit on
OL,13,FSaturday, with an amber weather warning
OL,14,Fissued from 21:00 BST across much of
OL,15,FScotland as well as parts of Northern
OL,16,FIreland and northern England where
OL,17,Fgusts of up to 80mph (128km/h) could
OL,18,Flash exposed areas.
OL,20,FTravel chaos, power cuts and localised
OL,21,Fflooding are all possible as the storm
OL,22,Fsweeps in on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
